---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Semmelweisklinik • Spontaneous Room Use"
  description="Internal guide for spontaneous use of Semmelweisklinik spaces by house members."
>
  <div class="page-wrapper">
    <div class="content container-narrow">

      <h1 class="hero-title">SPONTANEOUS ROOM USE</h1>
      <p class="subtitle mt-20">HOW TO</p>

      <h2 class="mt-50">Intro :: Awareness</h2>
      <p class="mt-20">
        The Semmelweisklinik depends on renting out its event spaces, because the income from studios alone does not cover the overall running costs of the building. So it matters to us that additional bookings happen and work out.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-20 but-label">BUT</p>
      <p class="mt-20">
        when rooms aren't rented out, they're of no use to anyone standing empty — so let's use them. <strong>Free of charge. No effort, no cost.</strong>
      </p>

      <div class="divider"></div>

      <h2>Conditions</h2>
      <ul class="mt-20">
        <li>Rooms can be reserved <strong>no more than 1 week in advance</strong></li>
        <li>
          <strong>No public events</strong>
          <span class="sub-note">(a contract is required for legal reasons)</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>No changes to the spaces</strong>
          <span class="sub-note">(everything set up must be dismantled immediately after use)</span>
        </li>
        <li><span class="highlight-item"><strong>Mind the noise level!</strong></span></li>
        <li>No high-draw appliances <strong>(&gt; 1,000 W)</strong></li>
      </ul>

      <div class="divider"></div>

      <h2>How it works in practice :: Step-by-step guide</h2>

      <ol class="mt-20 steps-list">
        <li>
          <strong>Check the calendar</strong> to see if the room you want is free at the time you want. If so, make a reservation:
          <br /><a href="https://kalender.digital/1d670462e848c0d7b0d0" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="calendar-link mt-10">kalender.digital/1d670462e848c0d7b0d0</a>
          <ul class="mt-10">
            <li><strong>Title</strong> = your name + PRIVATE (if you want to be undisturbed)</li>
            <li><strong>Description</strong> = your phone number + anything else you want to add</li>
            <li><strong>Time</strong> – please uncheck "all day" and enter specific times</li>
            <li><strong>Sub-calendar</strong> = choose the room</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="callout mt-20">
            <p><strong>Note:</strong> The following rooms are acoustically connected and require extra attention — they cannot be used at the same time:</p>
            <ul class="mt-10">
              <li>Waschküche + UG West</li>
              <li>UG West / Bandland + Bewegungsraum</li>
              <li>Bewegungsraum + Bar</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </li>

        <li class="mt-20">
          <span class="highlight-item"><strong>Check again the day before</strong></span> to see if something has been booked in the meantime. Paid bookings (shown as <em>Busy</em>) <strong><u>always take priority</u></strong> — the booking team works in a separate calendar and does not see entries made here.
        </li>

        <li class="mt-20">
          <span class="highlight-item"><strong>Leave the room clean!</strong></span> At least as clean as you found it — ideally cleaner. Cleaning supplies can be found in the east and central wing near the toilets, and in the west in the new cloakroom (next to the 2 older WCs). Give back to the space!
        </li>

        <li class="mt-20">
          <strong>Donations:</strong> If you are able to, or if external guests are using the room with you, please drop something in the donation box. We will place one in every room. If you don't see one yet, feel free to put one in!
        </li>
      </ol>

      <p class="mt-30 info-note">
        The UG West can only be used after a <strong>technical induction</strong>. Induction dates are announced in the Telegram info channel.
      </p>

      <p class="mt-30"><span class="highlight-item">If your use of the space causes extra work for the house (e.g. the room is not left empty or clean) and someone else has to do that work on your behalf, it will be charged according to <strong>Fairpay guidelines</strong>.</span></p>

      <div class="mt-80"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .subtitle {
    font-family: "Lexend Regular", sans-serif;
    font-size: 16px;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    opacity: 0.5;
  }

  .but-label {
    font-size: 28px;
    font-family: "Lexend Semibold", sans-serif;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
  }

  ul, ol {
    padding-left: 1.5em;
  }

  li {
    margin-top: 10px;
  }

  .sub-note {
    display: block;
    font-size: 15px;
    opacity: 0.65;
    margin-top: 2px;
    padding-left: 0.5em;
  }

  .highlight-item {
    background: rgba(255, 220, 0, 0.3);
    padding: 1px 4px;
    border-radius: 2px;
  }

  .calendar-link {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: "Lexend Regular", sans-serif;
    font-size: 15px;
    color: inherit;
    border-bottom: 1px solid currentColor;
    word-break: break-all;
  }

  .callout {
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
    border-left: 3px solid black;
    padding: 14px 18px;
    border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;
  }

  .callout p,
  .callout li {
    font-size: 16px;
  }

  .info-note {
    font-size: 16px;
    opacity: 0.75;
    font-style: italic;
  }

</style>
